    "answer": {
      "short": "$241\\text{ m}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}C&=180^\\circ-48^\\circ-67^\\circ\\\\C&=65^\\circ\\\\\\frac{BC}{\\sin48^\\circ}&=\\frac{85}{\\sin65^\\circ}\\\\BC&=\\frac{85\\sin48^\\circ}{\\sin65^\\circ}\\\\\\frac{AC}{\\sin67^\\circ}&=\\frac{85}{\\sin65^\\circ}\\\\AC&=\\frac{85\\sin67^\\circ}{\\sin65^\\circ}\\\\P&=85+\\frac{85\\sin48^\\circ}{\\sin65^\\circ}+\\frac{85\\sin67^\\circ}{\\sin65^\\circ}\\\\P&\\approx241\\text{ m}\\end{align*}$$",
